pirits while they endure dehumanizing abuse as inmates of a Magdalene Sisters Asylum.","popularity":6.2274,"poster_path":"/akOnyPsfzcDvCwP3lzY35i2NIha.jpg","release_date":"2002-08-30","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.454,"vote_count":492},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/gmrSsGUIcFc1nStXKmo8lTn2ZtC.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":833753,"title":"Child of Nature","original_language":"en","original_title":"Child of Nature","overview":"An epic journey of courage, hope and generosity, filmed in 15 countries. Child of Nature follows 5 connected stories of young people who, against all odds are transforming their lives and the lives of those around them.","popularity":1.3871,"poster_path":"/fQNUtjT7XHcJuH13ajuPvkVXUtn.jpg","release_date":"2021-05-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":10,"vote_count":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/fgRhyGbMAolDsQ65VRBRBtVQZNn.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18,36,10749],"id":7913,"title":"Rang De Basanti","original_language":"hi","original_title":"रंग दे बसंती","overview":"After a group of friends graduate from Delhi University, they listlessly haunt their old campus, until a British filmmaker casts them in a film she's making about freedom fighters under British rule. Although the group is largely apolitical, the tragic death of a friend owing to local government corruption awakens their patriotism. Inspired by the freedom fighters they represent in the film, the friends collectively decide to avenge the killing.","popularity":4.317,"poster_path":"/f1bF8CHzEu621bPSIg6XiUNAabh.jpg","release_date":"2006-01-26","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.106,"vote_count":534},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/rRFstCh4t1aAOpfCkF5lMMv2T91.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":1603877,"title":"Taraneh: A Documentary","original_language":"fa","original_title":"ترانه","overview":"Nearly three years have passed since the \"Woman, Life, Freedom\" protests in Iran. Many who took part in the 2022 (1401) demonstrations paid a heavy price: some were killed, many were permanently injured, others were sentenced to long prison terms, and many lost their jobs. Among the well-known figures who supported the protests was Taraneh Alidoosti, one of Iran’s most prominent film actresses. After she posted an unveiled photo of herself and later protested the execution of Mohsen Shekari, she was imprisoned. Following her release, she became ill and remained out of the public eye for some time. Alidoosti has also been banned from acting in cinema.  For the first time, in the documentary Taraneh, produced by Pegah Ahangarani, Alidoosti speaks about her decision to join the protest movement after the killing of Mahsa Amini. She talks about the day she was arrested at home in front of her little daughter and about the loss of her skin due to an autoimmune disease.","popularity":1.1705,"poster_path":"/3Pup42YpAVAQBPZCRDoBEfLiRvU.jpg","release_date":"2025-12-24","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.667,"vote_count":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ygTBp6GDxpXNtur57iOmTFQXMe8.jpg","genre_ids":[18,10749,36],"id":7504,"title":"Earth","original_language":"hi","original_title":"1947: Earth","overview":"In 1947, the borderlines between India and Pakistan are being drawn. A young girl bears witnesses to tragedy as her ayah is caught between the love of two men and the rising tide of political and religious violence.","popularity":1.6252,"poster_path":"/hQtvQYlxfEHl45TR41lNSywrq4K.jpg","release_date":"1998-09-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.568,"vote_count":44},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jycEYzpASmk6dUZGGt0lPSnyKSU.jpg","genre_ids":[99,80,18],"id":1031143,"title":"Another Body","original_language":"en","original_title":"Another Body","overview":"A college student searches for justice after she discovers deepfake pornography of herself circulating online.","popularity":1.3146,"poster_path":"/wilheE5NIfBRqNcDydoSo2t4OH5.jpg","release_date":"2023-10-20","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.8,"vote_count":14},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2HlsRjheklctU4XHvGZc2JhcDBI.jpg","genre_ids":[99,36,18,80],"id":1425709,"title":"Sorcières : chronique d'un massacre","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Sorcières : chronique d'un massacre","overview":"In 1609, Henry IV sent Inquisition judge Pierre de Lancre to the French Basque Country to investigate witchcraft. In the trials, 80 people were sentenced to death at the stake. Between the 15th and 17th centuries, a total of between 40,000 and 60,000 people fell victim to such waves of persecution in Europe. How can this phenomenon be explained?","popularity":2.1316,"poster_path":"/urWk0AbrDLjVw3AZZGhWtltHFeA.jpg","release_date":"2025-10-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.5,"vote_count":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/xtINpkfx7xNAQs3mg1WpokTiWof.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":644394,"title":"Johanna Dohnal - Visionary of Feminism","original_language":"de","original_title":"Die Dohnal","overview":"Johanna Dohnal, whose political career spans three decades, was one of the very first explicitly feminist politicians in Europe. As a member of the Austrian socialist government and the first Austrian minister for Women’s Affairs from 1990 to 1994, Dohnal was responsible for founding Austria’s first women’s refuge as well as criminalizing of marital rape. Yet her legacy remains yet to be discovered and re-examined. DIE DOHNAL makes a first step, and it makes Dohnal come alive.","popularity":1.1891,"poster_path":"/An6HHxeLU4YGl8P09S8GWvpvtAk.jpg","release_date":"2020-02-14","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":10,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":840631,"title":"They Saw the Sun First","original_language":"en","original_title":"They Saw the Sun First","overview":"A genre-bending documentary using dance and physicality to explore themes of youthfulness, fear, regret and aging. The star of the show is New York. The perspectives of elderly citizens of NYC are interpreted physically by a younger generation. The words come from real-life interviews recorded with a diverse selection of aging New Yorkers.","popularity":0.9745,"poster_path":"/rzAEjQCSvJBUgDNxAqKpBFajCW7.jpg","release_date":"2020-04-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":840672,"title":"Dedičstvo krásy a biedy","original_language":"sk","original_title":"Dedičstvo krásy a biedy","overview":"","popularity":0.7927,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"1948-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/z73xT9Kd48vefGeIUezvpLmAlM1.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":1228328,"title":"The Ramayana","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Ramayana","overview":"The Little Ballet Troupe of Bombay performs a \"puppet ballet\" of the Hindu epic, the Ramayana.","popularity":0.5796,"poster_path":"/1HHfV8S8CIdmsKmf6u4iieSYaq8.jpg","release_date":"1965-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/lkhxxBNRn7AFkQBPnlARQeAIbAH.jpg","genre_ids":[18,36,10752],"id":270567,"title":"Children of War","original_language":"hi","original_title":"Children of War","overview":"Children of War is a movie based on the true events of the 1971 Genocide. Can we, in search of power, become animals? A genocide; neglected! The first use of rape as a weapon of war; undocumented! The lives of millions; unaccounted! The culprits; unpunished!","popularity":0.9018,"poster_path":"/rQDaJNM9Qcv2UaZQfnUYEksyvta.jpg","release_date":"2014-05-18","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.7,"vote_count":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":1223488,"title":"Women of Today","original_language":"ro","original_title":"Femeile zilelor noastre","overview":"Made on the occasion of March 8, it presents a series of brief portraits of women, from various professional fields, of different ages and even of different ethnicities, pointing out the benefits that the communist organization had brought to their daily lives. A special emphasis is placed on their status as mothers and on the role of nurseries and socialist kindergartens not only in making their lives easier, but also in giving them the time they need to build a career. Another concern of the filmmaker, starting from the concrete case of one of the protagonists, is to highlight the differences between the happy present and the not-too-distant past in which someone with her social status should have dedicated herself exclusively to raising children, in hygienic and extremely difficult lives.","popularity":0.682,"poster_path":"/m9G7lWOfiqQM5LRH2XlaCvtrho5.jpg","release_date":"1958-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/pFNdRfAKC8Dd5f6jwSX3WUB1nmb.jpg","genre_ids":[36,80,18,53],"id":1223371,"title":"Accident or Conspiracy: Godhra","original_language":"hi","original_title":"गोधरा","overview":"A student whose parents died in the Gujarat pogrom receives an assignment on the same topic at his university. During his research, he meets everyone associated with the commission and tries to uncover various other aspects.","popularity":1.4313,"poster_path":"/7qhCjhhUcoQg7gqB2Q5N5IAZh6J.jpg","release_date":"2024-07-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.667,"vote_count":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":270952,"title":"The Life and Times of Allen Ginsberg","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Life and Times of Allen Ginsberg","overview":"Visionary, radical, spiritual seeker, renowned poet, founding member of a major literary movement, champion of human rights, Buddhist, political activist and teacher. Extensive archival footage, interviews, and home movies cover Allen Ginsberg's life, activism, and influence on American culture through the Beat era, the 1960s, and beyond.","popularity":1.8389,"poster_path":"/bd6xzKD1m8ECaD38kG0RVNj28I4.jpg","release_date":"1994-02-17","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.7,"vote_count":9},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/yNpCxbuXWq5iMYor35qMAuezntE.jpg","genre_ids":[99,36],"id":640586,"title":"Paris 1900","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Une si belle époque ! La France d'avant 1914","overview":"In 1900, the eyes of the whole world are on Paris. The World's Fair welcomed 50 million amazed visitors, and the city celebrated itself in a glamorous era. This period went down in history as the \"Belle Époque.\" Elaborately restored and colorized historical photographs bring to life the exciting life in Paris between the end of the 19th century and the beginning of World War I in 1914. Bicycles, cars, airplanes, moving pictures, newly founded film studios, revolutionary composers and painters, avant-garde ballet performances, fashion houses, summer resorts on the Atlantic coast – life was intoxicating. People celebrate in the variety shows, cabarets, and revue theaters of Paris. Moulin Rouge, Folies Bergères, Bal Tabarin—in Paris, the nights are long and life is too short to sleep through. It is a dance on the volcano, given the political developments in the world.","popularity":1.2416,"poster_path":"/dHaTlhPf4kz5cI3K2hG9p8Oxq4A.jpg","release_date":"2019-10-07","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.5,"vote_count":6},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":457686,"title":"We are Humanity","original_language":"hi","original_title":"We are Humanity","overview":"The Jarawas live in the Andaman Islands on the Indian Ocean. The origin of the tribe is in Africa some 70,000 years back. They have lived in almost perfect isolation from the rest of the world until recent times.","popularity":0.4332,"poster_path":"/4aXhAEXozPLa7ZAJF5sU4LxpeFK.jpg","release_date":"2018-05-02","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.5,"vote_count":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/uSLZBMjp9e8y1GR8ESisKbus6DN.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":1223889,"title":"Au cœur du Papotin","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Au cœur du Papotin","overview":"Since September 2022, \"Les Rencontres du Papotin\" has garnered significant attention, shining a spotlight on the work undertaken by its unique team of journalists—who have autism spectrum disorders—following more than 30 years with the publication *Le Papotin*. From editorial meetings to behind-the-scenes footage, this film offers a close-up look at the daily lives of this extraordinary editorial team. Featuring previously unseen archival footage, the documentary chronicles the initial encounters between the journalists and various prominent figures.","popularity":1.6075,"poster_path":"/83gjq9PxXMP0y28BNO0vwqlQP8r.jpg","release_date":"2023-12-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/khMiMb2wP6J466ZZKh1Flm420BT.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":640658,"title":"La vie au temps de Cro-Magnon","original_language":"fr","original_title":"La vie au temps de Cro-Magnon","overview":"","popularity":0.7299,"poster_path":"/hpIFwbkAJ8pARXxsGDw3pbDz9WH.jpg","release_date":"2019-10-19","softcore":false,"video":true,"vote_average":8,"vote_count":2}],"total_pages":1001,"total_results":20001},"videos":{"results":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"Writing With Fire  - Official Trailer","key":"uv51mXOvjJw","site":"YouTube","size":1080,"type":"Trailer","official":true,"id":"61b3cfc44cd9120041799a60","published_at":"2021-09-19T23:46:04.000Z"}]}}